<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Northern Border said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Northern Border said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Northern Border Partners LP to buy from neutral, a source at Smith Barney said.</p>
<p>-- Details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 26-3/4.</p>
</text>
